msgstr "Export the content to translate to an XLIFF file, the format of translation programs (Trados, memoQ, Phrase, Smartcat, OmegaT…). Each text is a segment: title, excerpt, every block text, the fields. On return, each item becomes a draft with the original’s structure and the translated texts."

